    },
    {
      "id": "2123954618191565201",
      "text": "Two Andrew Nembhard free throws get the Pacers back within one at halftime. They were outscored 26-11 after taking a 50-36 lead with 7:48 to go in the half. Cavs up 62-61 at the break.",
